  description: '3 Level 4 monsters

    Once per turn, you can also Xyz Summon "Zoodiac
    Tigermortar" by using 1 "Zoodiac" monster you control with a different name as
    Xyz Material. (If you used an Xyz Monster, any Xyz Materials attached to it also
    become Xyz Materials on this card.) This card gains ATK and DEF equal to the
    ATK and DEF of all "Zoodiac" monsters attached to it as Materials. Once per turn:
    You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card, then target 1 Xyz Monster you control
    and 1 "Zoodiac" monster in your Graveyard; attach that "Zoodiac" monster to that
    Xyz Monster as Xyz Material.'
